{
  "bodyHash": "7n7fMEJQ2Jw=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">簡易武器模組新增了8種武器，設計風格與原版遊戲完美融合。每種武器都有獨特的遊玩風格，旨在為玩家帶來各不相同的全新體驗。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組圍繞 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a> 模組進行平衡，但也可不依賴它單獨使用。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>武器列表</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鐮刀：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KeikcPj.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">傷害：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：慢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊範圍：極高 *Better Combat 屬性</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*造成流血效果，隨時間持續傷害，更高階級會延長流血時間</span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>巨劍：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JBhp5oz.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">傷害：高</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：慢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊範圍：高 *Better Combat 屬性</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*壓倒打擊：每第三次攻擊造成額外傷害</span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>長矛：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/idYcdKW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">傷害：極高</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：極慢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊範圍：極高 *Better Combat 屬性</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*騎兵：騎乘時增加傷害</span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>匕首：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iJuHMWb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">傷害：極低</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：極高</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊範圍：極低 *Better Combat 屬性</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*背刺：對未察覺的目標增加傷害並造成暈眩</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*擊退效果較低</span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>拳刃：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BKEh0SD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">傷害：中高</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：慢中</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊範圍：極低 *Better Combat 屬性</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*具有生命吸取效果，效果取決於擊中敵人的數量而非造成的傷害</span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>彎刀：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/h0b8SbV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">傷害：低中</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：中快</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊範圍：中 *Better Combat 屬性</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*復仇：根據失去的生命值增加傷害，更高階級會進一步增加傷害</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*鋒利附魔不會與復仇效果疊加，系統會自動選取提供最高傷害的效果</span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>喙錘：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uGLy9gl.png\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">傷害：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊範圍：中等 *Better Combat 屬性</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*致殘：造成緩速效果1秒</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*穿甲：對有護甲的目標造成額外傷害</span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>武士刀：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EIipFON.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">傷害：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊範圍：中等 *Better Combat 屬性</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*鬥志：每次攻擊增加攻擊速度</span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>開發中武器：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>*這些武器不一定會加入模組，一切尚未定案</em></span></p>\n<br>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>利爪</strong> - 低傷害，擊中敵人時提供暫時速度提升（可疊加），連續攻擊同一個敵人會造成流血效果</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">單手武器</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>戰斧</strong> - 中高傷害，傷害無視盾牌，受到傷害時會增加你的傷害，擊殺敵人也會增加你的傷害</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">所有效果皆可能變更，如果你有任何想法或建議，歡迎告訴我！</span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>相容性</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a> - 所有武器都使用了 Better Combat 模組提供的動畫與屬性</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-crits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Random Crits</a> - 安裝此模組後，彎刀與匕首有更高的機率觸發暴擊</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-corinthium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Corinthium</a> - 為所有武器增加科林斯合金版本</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ogfTkBm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oreganized\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oreganized</a> - 為所有武器增加銀金版本</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4O10gxV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"78\"></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a> - 為所有武器增加潘多瑞特版本</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A5IQZFJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"78\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a> - 為所有武器增加獄卒版本</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CedGhpK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"78\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enlightened-end\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enlightened End</a> - 為所有武器增加亞當瑪鋼版本 *已過時</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/71G15Z0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"78\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight Forest</a> - 為所有武器增加鐵木、鋼葉、騎士金屬與熾火版本</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5ZCCQS5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3zlCG7a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A2ERkx9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/y5gLbdA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>待新增相容性清單：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我計劃為所有熱門的工具組模組新增相容性。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>目前待辦清單：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Stalwart Dungeons</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Blue Skies</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Aquaculture 2</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Buddy Cards</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Upgraded Netherite</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forbidden and Arcanus</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Majrusz's Progressive Difficulty</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">LieonLion's Enderite</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Plus the End</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Create Addons (Alloyed, Stuff &amp; Additions)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Enderite Mod</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Copper Armor &amp; Tools</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Spirit</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">End's Phantasm</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Frosted Friends</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Additional Additions</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ice and Fire</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Aether</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你希望我新增清單中沒有的模組相容性，請告訴我。</span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>常見問題</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>你能更新到最新版本嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 可以，但更新需要時間，我會在有時間時進行</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>你能降級到 X 版本嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 不行，1.18.2 是支援的最低版本</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>有 Fabric 版本嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 沒有，但應可透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector</a> 運作</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>你能添加 X 武器嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 不行，利爪和戰斧是我僅計劃新增的武器</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>你能添加與 X 模組的相容性嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 通常可以，但別期望會很快完成</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>你能讓我們更改武器的屬性嗎？</strong></span></p><p>- <span style=\"font-size:14px\">可透過設定檔停用武器能力，其他屬性則可透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/property-modifier\" rel=\"nofollow\">Property Modifier</a> 修改</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>沒有 Better Combat 可以運作嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 可以，但可能不平衡</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>我可以在我的整合包中使用這個模組嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 可以</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>看看我的其他模組：</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-crits\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DZXdDbg.png\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-enchantments\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/d1vkzqv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/difficult-spawners\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c7OCwgw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/revised-phantoms\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DPgZLAI.png\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252finfernaleclipse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2zXV5hA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"184\" height=\"40\"></a></p>",
